{"job_id":"F-d919c4e3971e2314d25b","family_id":"F-d919c4e3971e2314d25b","title":"국군체육부대령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002706-210806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":7,"target_id":"70d552da8c10fb5221413ea495ddb4e0a1e937260e5240b68b721901f270c71c","source_hash":"fb8cd04580eced0663461f3b7f79d4617155f4e15125e3bd008f318f6a63cf11","text":"武装部队体育单位上校"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002706-210806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":113,"target_id":"9200afb05d4a51a8d00c39a002e2fe33d9052b9cea9e9e6931493ee0fdfd853f","source_hash":"5ec41bb4dfb82c249ab0b21fd8477a7cbf2f8e1c497fc59e7b6bca013f0a47df","text":"第一条（设立和使命）为了通过研究和发展军事人员体能提升理论，以及发现和培养具有特殊体育才能的人员，为增强军事力量做出贡献，在国防部长领导下设立武装部队体育单位（以下简称“体育单位”）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002706-210806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":113,"end":307,"target_id":"43a5f18985c2a6a43c51d2b0843317633d6f5e9debc2bba64e88f9d46056f6f3","source_hash":"6577ab3a58c632300c05595ab985400c268f5946a05fd4ff5761b17c18f0dfe4","text":"제2조(부대장과 부부대장)\n①체육부대에 부대장과 부부대장을 둔다.\n② 部队指挥官应由二级或以上文职人员担任，副指挥官应由校级军官担任。<2017年9月5日修订，2019年10月15日修订>\n部队指挥官奉国防部长之命，负责监督部队的行动，指挥和监督部队成员。\n副指挥官协助指挥官，并在指挥官缺席时履行指挥官的职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002706-210806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":307,"end":453,"target_id":"8906d2153e3a5058bb452988597068bd48165349bbea0810b1819812530a5b83","source_hash":"823c65c25ebf6cb7ad5225cc80d29078670184c3d7bc8653da3855c9a18610af","text":"第三条（部门和运动员队伍的设立）\n应当设立负责体育单位职责的各部门，有关各部门的设立和职责划分事宜由国防部长决定。\n② 武装部队体育单位内应当设立一支具有代表性的体育队伍，但有关该队伍的设立、组成、运动员选拔和体育比赛等事宜，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002706-210806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":453,"end":499,"target_id":"bfe93fe715940a9ee15d8dc1b20e33d35dfc353d60a53afc6139ab23dba76dab","source_hash":"003b6dd923a7938e0ba03097358f59de884998923120bfb4627ddca8ec2ae49c","text":"第四条（人员配额） 军事人员和文职人员应分配到体育单位，人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002706-210806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":499,"end":545,"target_id":"2be19b400f64ab4bb17dc3057e25b50fcc452ec1766cac1af2e8e4feea1e7842","source_hash":"878070a43096fb7e1a1de8fa22be5339de1f30d9f808614d4625d8ee2146370d","text":"补充规定 <第11288号，1983年12月29日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002706-210806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":545,"end":578,"target_id":"c63df669f713765b0dd99e1e01f6d7ef9ca36dec769820481fe2deb56e45a743","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002706-210806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":578,"end":615,"target_id":"cc5b6c14b14bd8710ee4e671b44539c8cbed3965ef8b7eb5bcfd59f024d26ca2","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002706-210806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":615,"end":629,"target_id":"d09f1c6d5566981839d8fdf7581c6eb8f896497987de5cde6be302a8962bbdb4","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"省略第2条和第3条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002706-210806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":629,"end":748,"target_id":"ec6541aec89db1c28f3642e9bb410a778952614eb1290aa8a2328eefc550cf2f","source_hash":"a0c51404e78fbc359633d892b7209f17c40fd5e46488c26cdedf732abee76ab8","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<18>款省略\n\n  <19> 武装部队体育单位条例部分内容修订如下。\n\n  第 2 条第 2 款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <20> 至 <90> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002706-210806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":748,"end":798,"target_id":"702b41d29e7927178d6f59960899dbcab8e2ddba64e90e83354c26750ba8978a","source_hash":"24483b738d298ce9acd318f39b0246038b7e032b170c3f8ab0e921d2f8c68cab","text":"补充规定 <第30121号，2019年10月15日>\n\n本法令自2019年12月1日起生效。"}]}